rsive educational platform that redefines science learning for middle school students. Designed with cutting-edge AR and VR technology, Abhigyaan offers a virtual playground where students can engage with science experiments like never before, making learning fun, safe, and impactful.\n\nIn Abhigyaan, learners can explore core science concepts hands-on, conducting experiments and practicing skills without the limitations of a traditional classroom setup. The app combines the power of augmented and virtual reality to create lifelike 3D simulations, providing students with a captivating environment that deepens understanding through interaction and curiosity-driven play.\n\nKey Features:\n\nImmersive Science Labs: Dive into realistic lab simulations and experiment freely.\nInteractive Learning: Manipulate equipment, measure results, and repeat experiments to learn at your own pace.\nEngaging Content: A playful setup that turns complex concepts into fun and memorable experiences.\nSafe and Accessible: Conduct science experiments anytime, anywhere, with zero risk and complete accessibility.\nWith Abhigyaan, we're committed to shaping the future of education by merging science and technology into a seamless, engaging experience. Whether in the classroom or at home, Abhigyaan empowers students to learn science in a way that's exciting, hands-on, and deeply effective.", "short_description": "Abhigyaan is a new age educational AR/VR based app, that allows middle school learners to perform and practice science experiments in a playful setup. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.qodequay.com/abhigyaan-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Qodequay Technologies Pvt. Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.qodequay.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "cont